WEBVTT

00:07.940 --> 00:09.400
<b>Hey!</b>

00:09.400 --> 00:12.400
<b>Lady Paladin with the battered armor!</b>

00:14.570 --> 00:18.280
<b>STREET STALL</b>

00:14.570 --> 00:18.280
<b>EQUIPMENT REPAIR
HIGH SEWING SKILLS
DISCOUNT AVAILABLE</b>

00:15.110 --> 00:17.200
<b>Would you like to get that fixed?</b>

00:17.200 --> 00:19.540
<b>I'll give you a discount
if you're a beginner!</b>

00:21.700 --> 00:23.120
<b>I'm Rurihime.</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:25.920
<b>Nice to meet you, Lady Paladin!</b>

00:27.590 --> 00:29.880
<b>There's something
I want to talk to you about.</b>

00:30.090 --> 00:31.130
<b>Do you mind?</b>

02:02.970 --> 02:05.720
<b>Episode 12:
I Like You</b>

02:03.470 --> 02:04.350
<b>Where am I?</b>

02:04.350 --> 02:05.720
<b>What a surprise!</b>

02:06.640 --> 02:09.190
<b>I thought you were going
to confess your love for me.</b>

02:09.440 --> 02:11.610
<b>Oh, sorry.
Was I giving off that kind of vibe?</b>

02:11.610 --> 02:13.730
<b>That's the only vibe you were giving off.</b>

02:13.730 --> 02:15.190
<b>Sorry.</b>

02:15.610 --> 02:17.700
<b>So, what did you want to tell me?</b>

02:17.700 --> 02:19.530
<b>Uh, right.</b>

02:20.200 --> 02:21.200
<b>See...</b>

02:22.490 --> 02:23.200
<b>10 MINUTES LATER</b>

02:23.580 --> 02:26.040
<b>Akane says she's in love with someone!</b>

02:26.330 --> 02:29.130
<b>SAVING TIME</b>

02:26.500 --> 02:29.120
<b>Didn't see that coming!
Congrats!</b>

02:29.830 --> 02:31.000
<b>Want me to guess who it is?</b>

02:33.130 --> 02:34.170
<b>Don't say it.</b>

02:35.750 --> 02:37.630
<b>This is so touching.</b>

02:37.630 --> 02:46.140
<b>STREET STALL</b>

02:38.340 --> 02:40.760
<b>When I first met you, Akanecchi,</b>

02:40.760 --> 02:44.350
<b>you were tottering about alone in-game,
looking bored.</b>

02:44.890 --> 02:48.890
<b>Now that I think about it, you were
probably a mess after just getting dumped.</b>

02:49.770 --> 02:51.520
<b>But now you've gotten back on your feet.</b>

02:51.940 --> 02:52.770
<b>Good for you.</b>

02:52.940 --> 02:55.730
<b>But she's still trying
to figure out why she got dumped,</b>

02:55.730 --> 02:56.940
<b>and she's agonizing over it!</b>

02:56.940 --> 02:59.280
<b>Huh? What's up with that?
That's so negative!</b>

03:00.360 --> 03:07.750
<b>Um, it may sound that way, but I just
want to know if I've done anything wrong.</b>

03:08.750 --> 03:12.540
<b>In my own mind, I'm thinking positive.</b>

03:13.670 --> 03:15.540
<b>That's why, see...</b>

03:16.340 --> 03:17.840
<b>I mean, it's just that...</b>

03:18.380 --> 03:23.840
<b>when I see your face, Eita, it really
makes me want to talk to Rurihime, too.</b>

03:25.010 --> 03:29.230
<b>Because it was Momo and Rurihime
who comforted me when things were tough.</b>

03:29.770 --> 03:35.270
<b>TONKOTSU</b>

03:30.890 --> 03:34.520
<b>I wanted to tell both of you
that I've fallen in love with someone.</b>

03:39.190 --> 03:41.530
<b>The guy you've
fallen in love with, Akanecchi,</b>

03:41.530 --> 03:44.570
<b>I've known him for years,
and he's a good guy.</b>

03:45.320 --> 03:49.910
<b>People tend to only talk about his looks,
but I've never met anyone as kind.</b>

03:50.450 --> 03:52.160
<b>Well, I'm sure you know that.</b>

03:52.160 --> 03:55.380
<b>But you know what, it's really true.</b>

03:56.170 --> 04:00.630
<b>He may be insensitive, but he's got
a big heart, so you can just be yourself.</b>

04:01.010 --> 04:03.340
<b>Being too straightforward
would be just right for him.</b>

04:04.300 --> 04:07.600
<b>Now go for it! You've got
Momo and me if you get dumped!</b>

04:07.600 --> 04:09.640
<b>He's right, Akane. A woman has to be bold!</b>

04:09.640 --> 04:11.430
<b>Once you've made up your mind, just do it!</b>

04:11.680 --> 04:13.730
<b>You know what? Just confess right now!</b>

04:13.730 --> 04:15.020
<b>You said it! You said it!</b>

04:15.730 --> 04:19.480
<b>F-Fine! I'll take my chances
and go for broke!</b>

04:19.480 --> 04:21.820
<b>Ah. Try not to get
too broken up, all right?</b>

04:21.820 --> 04:23.820
<b>I'll do my best not to get too broken!</b>

04:27.530 --> 04:28.370
<b>Yeah!</b>

04:35.580 --> 04:38.130
<b>Thanks! I love you both!</b>

04:43.550 --> 04:45.720
<b>I just hope she doesn't get broken.</b>

04:44.970 --> 04:48.140
<b>THE AFTERMATH WILL BE
SUCH A HASSLE...</b>

04:45.720 --> 04:48.140
<b>Well, no one knows what will happen.</b>

04:48.720 --> 04:51.680
<b>Oh, hello. Let me introduce myself again.
I'm Momoko Maeda.</b>

04:51.680 --> 04:53.100
<b>I'm Eita Sasaki.</b>

04:53.100 --> 04:54.600
<b>I'm a 20-year-old college student.</b>

04:54.600 --> 04:56.150
<b>I'm seriously looking for a husband.</b>

04:56.060 --> 04:58.400
<b>I SEE</b>

04:57.480 --> 04:58.610
<b>Do you have a girlfriend?</b>

05:02.320 --> 05:04.700
<b><i>When was it that I fell in love with him?</i></b>

05:07.660 --> 05:10.450
<b><i>Try as I might, I can't really remember.</i></b>

05:09.950 --> 05:11.580
<b>FORWARD
FORWARD</b>

05:11.040 --> 05:16.830
<b><i>But since he doesn't smile a lot,
it made me happy whenever he did smile.</i></b>

05:16.830 --> 05:20.840
<b>CROWDED...</b>

05:17.580 --> 05:19.500
<b><i>Trying to pretend that I didn't notice...</i></b>

05:20.000 --> 05:22.050
<b><i>telling myself
that we were just friends...</i></b>

05:23.630 --> 05:27.680
<b><i>All my efforts to brush it off...
they really didn't mean much.</i></b>

05:28.430 --> 05:30.050
<b>Oh, I'm so sorry!</b>

05:34.390 --> 05:35.770
<b><i>I'm panicking too much.</i></b>

05:36.890 --> 05:38.400
<b><i>Are you all right?</i></b>

05:47.860 --> 05:49.200
<b><i>I'll be all right now.</i></b>

06:04.460 --> 06:05.300
<b>Yes?</b>

06:08.970 --> 06:09.800
<b>What?</b>

06:15.390 --> 06:16.930
<b>H-Hey!</b>

06:18.850 --> 06:19.690
<b>Hey.</b>

06:21.480 --> 06:24.440
<b>Uh, what are you doing here?</b>

06:30.740 --> 06:36.540
<b>Well, you see, there's something
I just have to talk to you about. Um...</b>

06:32.280 --> 06:35.660
<b>Oh, my! Grandpa Kato,
is it already time for your walk?</b>

06:36.160 --> 06:39.620
<b>- Huh?
- Is it already time for your walk?</b>

06:39.620 --> 06:47.590
<b>- Oh. Oh, hello! The weather today is—
- Yes, it is very warm today, isn't it?</b>

06:41.380 --> 06:42.290
<b>Um...</b>

06:44.460 --> 06:45.920
<b>Um, today is...</b>

06:48.630 --> 06:51.890
<b>If only it could be
warm like today every day!</b>

06:51.220 --> 06:52.140
<b>Um...</b>

06:51.890 --> 06:53.180
<b>Yeah. Right.</b>

06:54.010 --> 06:56.930
<b>It really is... warm.</b>

06:57.680 --> 06:58.520
<b>Akane...</b>

06:58.520 --> 06:59.480
<b>Yes!</b>

06:59.060 --> 07:01.560
<b>By the way, the other day,</b>

06:59.480 --> 07:03.060
<b>Sorry, but I have to leave
for cram school soon.</b>

07:01.560 --> 07:06.070
<b>I saw your granddaughter, Emi,
in front of the station!</b>

07:03.060 --> 07:06.610
<b>You do? Sorry,
I thought you'd be off on Saturdays.</b>

07:06.070 --> 07:07.150
<b>Know who I'm talking about?</b>

07:07.490 --> 07:11.570
<b>I can listen to what you have to say,
but can it be on the way to the station?</b>

07:08.320 --> 07:13.660
<b>Emi! Emi, she's your granddaughter, right?</b>

07:11.570 --> 07:12.450
<b>Really?</b>

07:11.570 --> 07:12.660
<b>IT'S COLD</b>

07:12.740 --> 07:13.660
<b>COME ON INSIDE</b>

07:12.820 --> 07:13.660
<b>Uh...</b>

07:13.660 --> 07:14.490
<b>Emi!</b>

07:14.410 --> 07:16.580
<b>I mean, couldn't we
have done this over the phone?</b>

07:15.200 --> 07:17.040
<b>Emi's all grown up now, isn't she?</b>

07:17.240 --> 07:20.080
<b>Yes. Know who I'm talking about?</b>

07:18.160 --> 07:19.370
<b><i>Dummy!</i></b>

07:19.370 --> 07:21.830
<b><i>Yamada has his own schedule.</i></b>

07:21.920 --> 07:24.670
<b>That's right! She really is...</b>

07:22.630 --> 07:24.670
<b><i>You didn't even think of that.</i></b>

07:24.670 --> 07:27.130
<b>Sorry! I think I'll come back another—</b>

07:32.890 --> 07:35.550
<b>Hey, I hear that Emi's in a band!</b>

07:35.550 --> 07:37.560
<b>But it's going to rain tonight, so...</b>

07:42.520 --> 07:45.770
<b>I'm going to get changed,
so if you could wait a little...</b>

07:47.650 --> 07:49.610
<b>Uh, uh, sure!</b>

07:50.110 --> 07:52.490
<b>Sorry to bother you when you're busy.</b>

07:53.700 --> 07:55.160
<b>That startled me.</b>

07:55.780 --> 07:58.120
<b>By the way,
seems like you're over your cold.</b>

07:58.120 --> 08:00.500
<b>I am! Thanks to you!</b>

08:00.500 --> 08:02.120
<b>Oh, wait, I need to thank—</b>

08:03.830 --> 08:05.170
<b><i>Whoa...</i></b>

08:05.580 --> 08:06.880
<b><i>Turn around, will you?</i></b>

08:06.880 --> 08:08.420
<b>- Thanks for waiting.
- Oh!</b>

08:09.630 --> 08:10.920
<b>So what's this about?</b>

08:11.260 --> 08:14.890
<b>Sorry. I'm thinking
of how to bring it up right now.</b>

08:15.430 --> 08:17.050
<b>SINCE I NEVER ENVISIONED
DOING THIS IN THE STREET</b>

08:16.930 --> 08:17.930
<b><i>There's no time.</i></b>

08:18.850 --> 08:20.640
<b><i>I've got to say it now.</i></b>

08:20.640 --> 08:22.350
<b><i>That's why I came here, after all.</i></b>

08:23.350 --> 08:28.070
<b><i>But there's no reason
why I should tell him now</i></b>

08:28.070 --> 08:31.190
<b><i>in the street, when things are so hectic.</i></b>

08:32.440 --> 08:33.700
<b><i>Another day...</i></b>

08:34.320 --> 08:35.950
<b><i>when we have more time...</i></b>

08:36.780 --> 08:37.700
<b>Akane!</b>

08:39.660 --> 08:41.450
<b>The light was red.</b>

08:43.160 --> 08:44.870
<b>S-Sorry.</b>

08:44.870 --> 08:45.830
<b>Are you all right?</b>

08:46.330 --> 08:48.290
<b>You're really spaced out today.</b>

08:49.250 --> 08:51.920
<b><i>It's no good. I have no focus.</i></b>

08:52.630 --> 08:53.550
<b>Sorry.</b>

08:54.050 --> 08:57.140
<b><i>Even if I just buy myself time
being with him,</i></b>

08:57.140 --> 08:59.470
<b><i>I'm only causing trouble for Yamada.</i></b>

08:59.890 --> 09:00.930
<b><i>I'll do it another time.</i></b>

09:01.390 --> 09:03.680
<b>You know what? I think I'll pass today—</b>

09:05.230 --> 09:06.190
<b>Green...</b>

09:17.320 --> 09:21.450
<b><i>Maybe I'll just let myself
give in to his kindness forever</i></b>

09:21.450 --> 09:23.750
<b><i>and not say anything I shouldn't.</i></b>

09:24.790 --> 09:26.920
<b><i>But hiding my feelings like that...</i></b>

09:27.420 --> 09:30.040
<b><i>would kind of be cheating.</i></b>

09:31.920 --> 09:34.170
<b>All right,
I'm going to get on the train now.</b>

09:34.670 --> 09:35.800
<b>Okay.</b>

09:35.800 --> 09:38.590
<b>Sorry we ended up not getting to talk.</b>

09:39.430 --> 09:41.350
<b>I was running late, so I was in a rush.</b>

09:41.510 --> 09:43.970
<b>No, there was something wrong with me.</b>

09:44.480 --> 09:46.020
<b>There sure was.</b>

09:45.390 --> 09:46.350
<b>TOTALLY IGNORING
THE TRAFFIC IS CRAZY</b>

09:46.690 --> 09:48.350
<b>Well, another time, then.</b>

09:49.520 --> 09:50.360
<b>Okay.</b>

09:52.900 --> 09:54.490
<b>Is it something important?</b>

09:55.950 --> 09:59.660
<b>After class,
well, it's going to be really late...</b>

10:00.030 --> 10:01.780
<b>but if it's okay with you,
I'll call you.</b>

10:03.540 --> 10:05.450
<b>If it's something
you want to tell me today.</b>

10:06.580 --> 10:08.670
<b>Are you sure? Aren't you tired?</b>

10:08.670 --> 10:10.670
<b>Just listening won't be a problem.</b>

10:11.340 --> 10:14.300
<b><i>Though I'm not sure
if I'll be a good person to talk to.</i></b>

10:13.210 --> 10:14.960
<b>RESPONSE MACHINE</b>

10:16.970 --> 10:18.050
<b>Yay!</b>

10:23.720 --> 10:25.060
<b>Okay, I'll be going now.</b>

10:25.310 --> 10:27.730
<b>Have a good one!
Good luck with your class!</b>

10:28.060 --> 10:30.060
<b>BYE NOW!</b>

10:42.240 --> 10:44.790
<b>The weather turned nasty all of a sudden,
didn't it?</b>

10:44.790 --> 10:46.450
<b>I mean, it was sunny just a minute ago.</b>

10:51.960 --> 10:55.340
<b>KAWAI CRAM SCHOOL</b>

10:53.840 --> 10:55.340
<b>All right, that's it for tonight.</b>

10:55.920 --> 10:58.840
<b>Make sure you do the writing exercises
on your own.</b>

10:59.930 --> 11:02.220
<b>It's raining, huh?</b>

11:02.470 --> 11:03.930
<b>Yamada, what are you going to do?</b>

11:03.930 --> 11:05.430
<b>In this downpour...</b>

11:05.430 --> 11:07.220
<b>I've got an umbrella, the fold-up kind.</b>

11:07.220 --> 11:08.480
<b>You're a god!</b>

11:07.220 --> 11:08.480
<b>SINCE I CHECKED THE WEATHER REPORT</b>

11:08.640 --> 11:11.100
<b>LET ME IN 'TIL WE
REACH THE STATION</b>

11:08.850 --> 11:10.480
<b>Share your umbrella with me!</b>

11:10.480 --> 11:11.850
<b>- Sure.
- Yeah!</b>

11:10.480 --> 11:11.850
<b>NOT LIKE I HAVE A CHOICE</b>

11:12.270 --> 11:13.730
<b>Will you be okay, Prez?</b>

11:14.230 --> 11:17.110
<b>I don't have an umbrella, either,
but I guess I'll run home.</b>

11:16.360 --> 11:18.990
<b>USING THE ROOF-TO-ROOF METHOD</b>

11:17.280 --> 11:18.990
<b>Isn't that a little too brave of you?</b>

11:20.030 --> 11:21.320
<b>Oh, what the heck.</b>

11:21.570 --> 11:24.120
<b>I'll give up my spot
under Yamada's umbrella for you, Prez.</b>

11:24.120 --> 11:26.080
<b>- Huh?
- You're cool with that, right, Yamada?</b>

11:26.330 --> 11:27.660
<b>Either one of you will be fine.</b>

11:27.660 --> 11:30.410
<b>Huh? But I'd feel bad.
Why don't you two leave together?</b>

11:30.410 --> 11:33.250
<b>No, no, how could I put my own needs
over that of a lady's?</b>

11:33.750 --> 11:37.130
<b>And by the way, this is your chance
to go home together, so you should pounce.</b>

11:38.920 --> 11:41.430
<b>You don't need
to look out for me like that.</b>

11:41.930 --> 11:43.640
<b>Yamada will think I'm weird.</b>

11:44.350 --> 11:47.890
<b>But you'll never get anywhere
unless you come off as a little weird.</b>

11:48.220 --> 11:49.480
<b>Especially you.</b>

11:53.730 --> 11:56.900
<b><i>They can't settle it, because they're
trying to give it up to each other?</i></b>

11:58.780 --> 12:01.490
<b><i>Maybe I'll just give them my umbrella
and run.</i></b>

12:01.110 --> 12:04.620
<b>I WANT TO GO HOME...</b>

12:03.700 --> 12:04.780
<b>Yamada?</b>

12:06.280 --> 12:07.330
<b>Um...</b>

12:08.490 --> 12:11.540
<b>On second thought,
can you share your umbrella with me</b>

12:11.540 --> 12:13.330
<b>until we get to the station?</b>

12:14.790 --> 12:17.340
<b>So I gave that new game a try.</b>

12:17.960 --> 12:20.590
<b>It's really buggy
since it's still in beta,</b>

12:20.590 --> 12:22.590
<b>but it looks like
it's going to be really good.</b>

12:28.890 --> 12:29.930
<b>Hurry up!</b>

12:29.930 --> 12:31.480
<b>Wait up!</b>

12:31.480 --> 12:32.890
<b>You're so slow, Saki!</b>

12:32.890 --> 12:34.690
<b>My shoes are slippery!</b>

12:37.770 --> 12:38.980
<b>Do you know her?</b>

12:39.400 --> 12:40.360
<b>What?</b>

12:40.360 --> 12:44.490
<b>Because you couldn't take your eyes
off that woman who ran by just now.</b>

12:46.410 --> 12:47.450
<b>I don't know her.</b>

13:04.010 --> 13:04.840
<b>Uh...</b>

13:05.220 --> 13:08.970
<b>Ms. Tsubaki,
please take this for yourself, after all.</b>

13:13.980 --> 13:15.270
<b>What? Why?</b>

13:15.480 --> 13:17.980
<b>It would defeat the purpose
if you got wet. So please.</b>

13:17.980 --> 13:19.690
<b>But no, what about you?</b>

13:19.690 --> 13:20.690
<b>I'll make a run for it.</b>

13:20.690 --> 13:22.190
<b>- But—
- The station's right there.</b>

13:22.190 --> 13:23.030
<b>Um...</b>

13:23.650 --> 13:24.490
<b>Wait.</b>

13:46.090 --> 13:46.930
<b>Wait!</b>

13:47.890 --> 13:48.890
<b>Wait!</b>

13:49.470 --> 13:50.470
<b>Wait, Yamada!</b>

13:52.520 --> 13:53.720
<b>Wait!</b>

13:55.770 --> 13:56.600
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:00.400 --> 14:01.230
<b><i>My glasses...</i></b>

14:04.400 --> 14:05.610
<b><i>I can't see.</i></b>

14:20.540 --> 14:21.380
<b>They're cracked.</b>

14:24.380 --> 14:25.590
<b>Are you all right?</b>

14:31.720 --> 14:32.810
<b>I like you.</b>

14:32.810 --> 14:33.640
<b>What?</b>

14:41.480 --> 14:42.310
<b>I like you.</b>

15:14.600 --> 15:16.270
<b>Sorry to put you on the spot.</b>

15:17.930 --> 15:21.810
<b>But please, just for today...</b>

15:23.190 --> 15:26.780
<b>I want you to try thinking of me.</b>

15:31.530 --> 15:33.070
<b>It can be just for today.</b>

15:45.790 --> 15:47.550
<b>AKITO YAMADA
I can't talk today after all
Let's do it another day when you have time
Sorry</b>

15:47.550 --> 15:49.800
<b>I can't talk today after all
Let's do it another day
when you have time
Sorry</b>

16:02.190 --> 16:04.980
<b>Hey, wasn't it raining
really hard yesterday?</b>

16:05.360 --> 16:08.280
<b>Runa was asleep, but it woke me up.
It was so loud!</b>

16:08.280 --> 16:10.950
<b>And to make matters worse,
I couldn't sleep a wink after that.</b>

16:09.240 --> 16:11.610
<b>I PLAYED A LITTLE BIT</b>

16:10.950 --> 16:12.990
<b>You're not concentrating at all,
are you, Runa?</b>

16:13.110 --> 16:14.450
<b>That's right! I'm not anymore.</b>

16:18.620 --> 16:20.410
<b>Good work, studying so hard!</b>

16:20.410 --> 16:23.040
<b>I bought you some doughnuts,
so please have some, both of you!</b>

16:23.040 --> 16:23.870
<b>Yay!</b>

16:23.870 --> 16:25.920
<b>Yamada,
I really appreciate your doing this</b>

16:25.920 --> 16:27.880
<b>when you're studying for exams yourself.</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:32.220
<b>Runa just wouldn't hear
of any other tutor but you!</b>

16:32.220 --> 16:34.220
<b>She must really adore you!</b>

16:34.550 --> 16:38.680
<b>But I have to say, seeing you two
together, you make such a nice couple!</b>

16:38.680 --> 16:40.020
<b>Right, Brother?</b>

16:38.680 --> 16:42.890
<b>I WANT YOU AS MY
GORGEOUS SON-IN-LAW</b>

16:38.680 --> 16:42.890
<b>I WANT YOU AS MY
BRILLIANT SON-IN-LAW</b>

16:38.680 --> 16:42.890
<b>I WANT YOU
AS MY SON-IN-LAW</b>

16:40.020 --> 16:42.890
<b>Listen to you, Mom,
not hiding your ambitions at all!</b>

16:43.100 --> 16:44.310
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

16:44.310 --> 16:45.150
<b>I have no clue.</b>

16:45.600 --> 16:48.440
<b>All I'm saying is that those two
make a sweet couple!</b>

16:48.440 --> 16:49.900
<b>Don't they, though? Don't they, though?</b>

16:49.150 --> 16:54.030
<b>AMBITIONS?</b>

16:49.900 --> 16:51.530
<b>Do you know what they're talking about?</b>

16:51.530 --> 16:52.530
<b>I don't know.</b>

16:51.530 --> 16:54.030
<b>TWO PEOPLE WHO DON'T REALLY UNDERSTAND</b>

16:52.530 --> 16:54.450
<b>Must be some kind
of joke, I guess?</b>

16:56.490 --> 16:57.660
<b>By the way, Akito...</b>

16:57.660 --> 17:00.660
<b>didn't someone confess to you?</b>

17:00.660 --> 17:02.040
<b>WHAAAT</b>

17:01.290 --> 17:02.040
<b>HEY, HEY
THE ANSWERS DON'T MATCH</b>

17:02.580 --> 17:04.040
<b>How did you know?</b>

17:03.540 --> 17:05.790
<b>SCARY, HUH</b>

17:04.040 --> 17:05.790
<b>I know everything, okay?</b>

17:06.330 --> 17:08.840
<b><i>So Akanecchi really confessed, huh?</i></b>

17:08.840 --> 17:10.420
<b><i>That girl's amazing.</i></b>

17:10.670 --> 17:12.090
<b>So what did you do?</b>

17:10.670 --> 17:15.050
<b>SHOW ME</b>

17:12.090 --> 17:13.260
<b>What did you say?</b>

17:13.260 --> 17:14.550
<b>It's not your concern.</b>

17:14.550 --> 17:15.630
<b>Oh, yes, it is.</b>

17:15.630 --> 17:16.550
<b><i>It is, huh?</i></b>

17:18.350 --> 17:19.560
<b>I'm thinking.</b>

17:21.270 --> 17:23.060
<b>Oh, so it's like that, huh?</b>

17:23.060 --> 17:26.100
<b>I was sure that you'd
actually go for it, too.</b>

17:26.100 --> 17:27.020
<b>Huh?</b>

17:27.020 --> 17:28.480
<b>Since you're so close.</b>

17:28.480 --> 17:29.320
<b>Well...</b>

17:29.610 --> 17:31.690
<b>You really are vague.</b>

17:30.440 --> 17:33.570
<b>IT WON'T DO YOU ANY GOOD
TO THINK LONG AND HARD ABOUT IT</b>

17:32.400 --> 17:35.200
<b>You should give her your answer
sooner than later, and be clear.</b>

17:35.200 --> 17:37.320
<b>Being suggestive with someone,
then toying with them</b>

17:37.320 --> 17:38.820
<b>is the worst thing you could do!</b>

17:41.040 --> 17:42.620
<b>That's not what I'm doing.</b>

17:44.290 --> 17:46.540
<b>Stupid Eita made Yamada mad again!</b>

17:44.290 --> 17:46.790
<b>GIGGLE</b>

17:46.540 --> 17:47.370
<b>Huh?</b>

17:46.790 --> 17:47.370
<b>TEE-HEE</b>

17:47.370 --> 17:50.090
<b>I'm so sorry, Akkun! Don't be mad!
I'll give you these doughnuts!</b>

17:50.090 --> 17:51.880
<b>Excuse me, but those are Runa's doughnuts!</b>

17:52.670 --> 17:53.960
<b><i>The number you've reached</i></b>

17:53.960 --> 17:58.140
<b><i>is either out of signal range
or has been turned off.</i></b>

18:00.180 --> 18:01.010
<b>Oh, my!</b>

18:01.970 --> 18:03.640
<b>Akane! Akane!</b>

18:03.890 --> 18:05.390
<b>See who's outside!</b>

18:06.440 --> 18:08.650
<b>Hey! Yamada!</b>

18:10.360 --> 18:11.860
<b>What are you doing?</b>

18:11.860 --> 18:14.610
<b>It's unusual for you to stop by our store.</b>

18:14.610 --> 18:16.450
<b>Aren't you supposed to be working?</b>

18:16.450 --> 18:18.410
<b>I asked to do some outside work.</b>

18:18.410 --> 18:20.660
<b>Now, then, have you come to see me?</b>

18:20.660 --> 18:21.830
<b>Just kidding!</b>

18:21.830 --> 18:23.040
<b>- Yes.
- Huh?</b>

18:23.370 --> 18:26.370
<b>I just called you,
but I couldn't reach you.</b>

18:26.370 --> 18:28.790
<b>You did, huh? Sorry about that!</b>

18:28.790 --> 18:32.340
<b>My battery was already down to 3%
when I left the house...</b>

18:29.670 --> 18:33.170
<b>I THINK THE BATTERY
RAN OUT...</b>

18:32.340 --> 18:33.170
<b>That's okay.</b>

18:33.840 --> 18:35.760
<b>I just thought
if I could see you in person,</b>

18:35.760 --> 18:37.880
<b>I could apologize for yesterday.</b>

18:38.550 --> 18:39.390
<b>No—</b>

18:42.350 --> 18:43.680
<b>I don't mind at all!</b>

18:44.220 --> 18:45.810
<b>It wasn't really important anyway.</b>

18:46.310 --> 18:49.850
<b>And come to think of it,
I've already talked to Momo about it,</b>

18:49.850 --> 18:52.440
<b>so I've pretty much
gotten it off my chest, I guess.</b>

18:52.820 --> 18:54.440
<b>Never mind that.</b>

18:54.820 --> 18:56.320
<b>You seem a little down today.</b>

18:56.570 --> 18:57.490
<b>What's the matter?</b>

18:58.740 --> 19:01.660
<b>Do I? I'm feeling pretty normal.</b>

19:01.660 --> 19:03.580
<b>What? You're so not like yourself!</b>

19:03.580 --> 19:04.990
<b>There's no energy in your voice!</b>

19:04.990 --> 19:06.450
<b>Well, that's always the case.</b>

19:06.450 --> 19:08.000
<b>You're also not very talkative.</b>

19:08.000 --> 19:09.830
<b>Well, that's always the case, too, but...</b>

19:10.000 --> 19:11.290
<b>This is how you always are!</b>

19:11.540 --> 19:12.840
<b>But this is how you are today!</b>

19:12.840 --> 19:14.000
<b>I DON'T SEE THE DIFFERENCE</b>

19:14.000 --> 19:14.840
<b>ANYWAY,
YOU'RE SOMETHING ELSE</b>

19:18.590 --> 19:22.470
<b>Lately, I've been a little busy,
so maybe I'm tired?</b>

19:23.140 --> 19:24.430
<b>I'm not really sure.</b>

19:24.760 --> 19:26.850
<b>Tired out from studying
for your entrance exams?</b>

19:27.640 --> 19:29.140
<b><i>I'm sure it's tough.</i></b>

19:28.350 --> 19:30.350
<b>IN TERMS OF SCORES</b>

19:29.140 --> 19:31.560
<b><i>His problems are
on a whole different planet than mine.</i></b>

19:31.900 --> 19:32.730
<b>I see.</b>

19:36.320 --> 19:40.450
<b>Hey! I recently got some new FOS gear.</b>

19:40.990 --> 19:45.780
<b>I've been dying to brag about it to you,
but you never seem to log in.</b>

19:45.780 --> 19:47.620
<b>See, I got myself a better sword.</b>

19:48.120 --> 19:49.120
<b>What kind of sword?</b>

19:49.620 --> 19:51.670
<b>What kind?</b>

19:51.670 --> 19:52.540
<b>What do you mean?</b>

19:52.540 --> 19:55.040
<b>You know, like the weapon rank or type.</b>

19:55.040 --> 19:58.300
<b>LIKE REALITY...</b>

19:56.840 --> 19:58.300
<b>Uh, let's see.</b>

19:59.090 --> 20:00.300
<b>Hold out your hand.</b>

20:00.300 --> 20:01.930
<b>Is that oil-based?</b>

20:01.930 --> 20:03.010
<b>Hold out your hand.</b>

20:04.470 --> 20:07.180
<b>Those bosses
sure drop some great items, huh?</b>

20:07.180 --> 20:19.190
<b>THERE'S DECORATIONS ON IT,
BUT IT'S SOMETHING LIKE THIS,
AND IT'S REALLY CUTE</b>

20:07.520 --> 20:11.600
<b>I finally get
why you're always raiding bosses.</b>

20:11.600 --> 20:13.810
<b>Well, but the odds are slim.</b>

20:13.810 --> 20:17.940
<b>I know! So when a decent item does drop,
it makes you feel outrageously happy.</b>

20:17.940 --> 20:19.190
<b>It gives you the shivers, right?</b>

20:20.740 --> 20:24.070
<b>I don't know what's going on,
but cheer up, all right?</b>

20:24.740 --> 20:27.330
<b>Go back to being the mysterious Yamada
you were before.</b>

20:28.450 --> 20:31.410
<b>I'LL DRAW YOU MY CHARACTER, TOO</b>

20:29.790 --> 20:31.410
<b>WHAT KIND OF CLOTHES
WAS SHE WEARING AGAIN?</b>

20:33.120 --> 20:35.170
<b>So that's how I look to people.</b>

20:38.170 --> 20:43.180
<b>I don't say much, because I'm afraid
that I'll say the wrong thing, that's all.</b>

20:44.930 --> 20:47.600
<b>I can't read into other people's feelings.</b>

20:48.100 --> 20:51.180
<b>And a lot of times,
I don't get their jokes.</b>

20:52.390 --> 20:54.310
<b>I'm just a nobody.</b>

20:55.230 --> 20:56.360
<b>I know I am.</b>

20:59.610 --> 21:00.900
<b>Hmm.</b>

21:02.440 --> 21:05.780
<b>For me, you know how you
sometimes set me straight</b>

21:05.780 --> 21:07.530
<b>in that astute way of yours?</b>

21:07.530 --> 21:10.580
<b>I really, um, like that.</b>

21:11.080 --> 21:13.120
<b>And when you're with us,
you don't say a word,</b>

21:13.120 --> 21:15.960
<b>but I know you're watching
everyone else and looking out for them.</b>

21:16.380 --> 21:19.750
<b>And I know that you always try
to help people out if they're in trouble.</b>

21:20.250 --> 21:22.800
<b>Because you've done that for me
so many times.</b>

21:24.260 --> 21:25.930
<b>You're not a nobody.</b>

21:25.930 --> 21:27.220
<b>I told you, you're a fun guy!</b>

21:27.800 --> 21:30.430
<b>You can trust me! I mean it.</b>

21:32.100 --> 21:32.980
<b>Okay?</b>

23:04.400 --> 23:07.440
<b><i>I wake up in the morning and sigh.</i></b>

23:08.320 --> 23:11.950
<b><i>Somewhere along the way,
that became a habit of mine.</i></b>

23:15.580 --> 23:17.080
<b><i>I was sure that love...</i></b>

23:17.710 --> 23:20.460
<b>Yukari, you're going out at this hour?</b>

23:20.920 --> 23:23.790
<b>Just for a bit.
I'm supposed to meet a friend.</b>

23:24.380 --> 23:26.340
<b>Just come home as soon as you can.</b>

23:26.340 --> 23:27.170
<b>Okay.</b>

23:28.470 --> 23:31.970
<b><i>...was supposed to be more fun than this.</i></b>
